{
  "about": "Infomaniak Calendar events listed, read, created and edited without inviting anyone; calendars listed.",
  "base": "https://api.infomaniak.com",
  "calls": [
    {
      "about": "List the calendars, each with the id the other calls take as calendarId",
      "answer": {
        "max": 65536,
        "select": [
          "result",
          "data",
          "error"
        ]
      },
      "kind": "read",
      "name": "calendars",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/1/calendar/pim/calendar"
      }
    },
    {
      "about": "List a calendar's events in a window, in one answer. timeMin and timeMax are a wall clock in the account's own timezone, 'YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS', with no offset and no T: Infomaniak reads them so, and an RFC 3339 value is refused before anything is sent. calendarId is an id calendars lists.",
      "answer": {
        "max": 262144,
        "select": [
          "result",
          "data",
          "error"
        ]
      },
      "kind": "read",
      "name": "events",
      "params": [
        {
          "log": true,
          "max": 64,
          "name": "calendarId",
          "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]*[0-9][A-Za-z0-9_-]*$",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "name": "timeMin",
          "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2} [0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}$",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "name": "timeMax",
          "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2} [0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}$",
          "type": "string"
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/1/calendar/pim/event",
        "query": [
          {
            "key": "calendar_id",
            "value": "{calendarId}"
          },
          {
            "key": "from",
            "value": "{timeMin}"
          },
          {
            "key": "to",
            "value": "{timeMax}"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "about": "Read one event, by the id events lists",
      "answer": {
        "max": 65536,
        "select": [
          "result",
          "data",
          "error"
        ]
      },
      "kind": "read",
      "name": "event",
      "params": [
        {
          "log": true,
          "max": 15,
          "name": "eventId",
          "pattern": "^[1-9][0-9]{0,14}$",
          "type": "string"
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/1/calendar/pim/event/{eventId}"
      }
    },
    {
      "about": "Create a timed event, inviting no one. start and end are a wall clock, 'YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS', in timezone, an IANA name such as Europe/Zurich. calendarId is an id calendars lists.",
      "answer": {
        "max": 65536,
        "select": [
          "result",
          "data",
          "error"
        ]
      },
      "kind": "update",
      "name": "create",
      "params": [
        {
          "log": true,
          "max": 64,
          "name": "calendarId",
          "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]*[0-9][A-Za-z0-9_-]*$",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "max": 500,
          "name": "summary",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "name": "start",
          "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2} [0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}$",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "name": "end",
          "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2} [0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}$",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "max": 64,
          "name": "timezone",
          "pattern": "^[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9_+-]*(/[A-Za-z0-9_+-]+){0,2}$",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "max": 10000,
          "name": "description",
          "optional": true,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "max": 500,
          "name": "location",
          "optional": true,
          "type": "string"
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "body": {
          "attendees": [],
          "calendar_id": "{calendarId}",
          "description": "{description}",
          "end": "{end}",
          "freebusy": "busy",
          "fullday": false,
          "location": "{location}",
          "notifyAttendees": false,
          "start": "{start}",
          "timezone_end": "{timezone}",
          "timezone_start": "{timezone}",
          "title": "{summary}",
          "type": "event"
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/1/calendar/pim/event"
      }
    },
    {
      "about": "Change an event, only what is given: it is read, changed and sent back whole, so its attendees, alarms and the rest stay as they were. start and end are a wall clock in the event's own timezone. An event that recurs is refused, and so are the times of an all-day one.",
      "answer": {
        "max": 65536,
        "select": [
          "result",
          "data",
          "error"
        ]
      },
      "build": [
        "infomaniak-calendar/build-edit"
      ],
      "kind": "update",
      "name": "edit",
      "params": [
        {
          "log": true,
          "max": 15,
          "name": "eventId",
          "pattern": "^[1-9][0-9]{0,14}$",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "max": 500,
          "name": "summary",
          "optional": true,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "name": "start",
          "optional": true,
          "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2} [0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}$",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "name": "end",
          "optional": true,
          "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2} [0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}$",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "max": 10000,
          "name": "description",
          "optional": true,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "max": 500,
          "name": "location",
          "optional": true,
          "type": "string"
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "path": "/1/calendar/pim/event/{eventId}"
      }
    }
  ],
  "check": "calendars",
  "credential": {
    "env": "INFOMANIAK_CALENDAR_TOKEN",
    "header": "Authorization: Bearer {credential}"
  },
  "name": "infomaniak-calendar"
}
